{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/fbd293ad87ee3a027ec40d5ed0ea8443.poster.avif?t=1772544875\" width=780 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/fbd293ad87ee3a027ec40d5ed0ea8443.webm?t=1772544875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/fbd293ad87ee3a027ec40d5ed0ea8443.mp4?t=1772544875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>     <strong>Co-working just got cuter!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On-Together: Virtual Co-Working is a digital third space designed to help you focus and stay connected. Work or study with your friends and strangers from all over the world!<br>      </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-work with friends or strangers in a cozy virtual workspace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in fullscreen, on the side of your screen or in transparent sticker mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use productivity tools including a customisable Pomodoro timer and to-do list to stay on track.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your avatars all sit together in the corner of your screen while you work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet up in a variety of locations including a library, treehouse and floating lily pads!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the focus animation for your character that matches your real life task, like reading, doing chores or painting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your avatar your own, choosing from a huge variety of human and animal customisation options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn tickets as you focus that you can trade for new clothing, power ups, pet companions AND MORE!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take regular breaks and play minigames like basketball, fishing or music jams!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hang out! Lock in! Repeat!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/d14c48eaf7a4b2d1e6d14e22ff159556.poster.avif?t=1772544875\" width=780 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/d14c48eaf7a4b2d1e6d14e22ff159556.webm?t=1772544875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/d14c48eaf7a4b2d1e6d14e22ff159556.mp4?t=1772544875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Focus Pokus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3707400/5731b3fd8246a3300f8974da86b7812cae0796fa.jpg"},{"name":"Clocked In","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3707400/bbe30bcb5798f1af2ee574edfed979e48764a85b.jpg"},{"name":"Timer Tamer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3707400/84189582d567642a3026d873bb27699eafff4a84.jpg"},{"name":"Time's Your Friend Now","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3707400/58616c4bb0b2fcc0c6328cdf73da5b720bddb6e3.jpg"},{"name":"Cute but Concentrated","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3707400/b0642bfcf6a4230c25ffa117720d0f11494769bf.jpg"},{"name":"Giga Pom Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3707400/2ad2d4e6c027cd3373ac0aae2dd9b41b68e6c92a.jpg"},{"name":"Midwa